istory of Liberl, Estelle and her allies battle to find Joshua and untangle the web of intrigue and conspiracy woven by Ouroboros!", "summary": "A remake of the second installment in the main Trails series, serving as a direct sequel of Trails in the Sky 1st Chapter. The game follows Estelle as she sets out on a new adventure following the events of the previous game, where she will be joined by comrades both old and new.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/trails-in-the-sky-2nd-chapter", "videos": [{"id": 168035, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "KF5WkAdv2tE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KF5WkAdv2tE", "title": "Trails in the Sky 2nd Chapter Remake - Teaser ", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KF5WkAdv2tE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 171445, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "4fEzsQ6Hv8Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4fEzsQ6Hv8Y", "title": "Trails in the Sky 2nd Chapter - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4fEzsQ6Hv8Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 174953, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "09CpH5vaZKM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=09CpH5vaZKM", "title": "Trails in the Sky 2nd Chapter - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/09CpH5vaZKM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 181445, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "hkII_nSxzkc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hkII_nSxzkc", "title": "Trails in the Sky 2nd Chapter \u2014 Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hkII_nSxzkc/fhddefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2413, "name": "The Legend of Heroes: Trails"}]}